      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. so if people are using those things like heritability and specific genes to make their point, how do they bridge the gap from \"genes affect intelligence\" to saying \"this explains the differences we see between racial groups\"? like what's their actual argument for how those genetic markers translate into racial hierarchy?",
